{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">RETURN-VALUE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310532","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RETURN-VALUE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RETURN-VALUE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">RETURN-VALUE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__section_N1002D_N1002A_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Provides a character string value returned\nby the most recently executed RETURN statement of a local or remote\nprocedure, trigger block, user-defined function, method of a class,\nclass constructor, or property accessor.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__syntax_GC1A1622702775\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d389235e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__idGDO2WL2676082\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>RETURN-VALUE</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__example_GC1A1632702779\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d389235e127\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">For\nexamples of the RETURN-VALUE function, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RETURN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RETURN-statement.html\">RETURN statement</a> reference\nentry.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__notes_GC1A1642702785\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d389235e140\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\nreturned value has the CHARACTER data type.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">When you access RETURN-VALUE, its value represents the value returned\nby the most recently executed RETURN or THROW:<ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\">If it is a\nRETURN with options that can set the RETURN-VALUE, but does not,\nthe empty string (&quot;&quot;) is returned.</li><li class=\"li\">If it is a THROW that returns a Progress.Lang.AppError object, the\nvalue of the object&#39;s ReturnValue property is returned.</li></ul></li>\n        <li class=\"li\">To reliably access a RETURN-VALUE setting returned from a block or\ncalled routine, check RETURN-VALUE as soon as you can after the block\nor called routine terminates.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">RETURN-VALUE does not return the value of a non-VOID method of\na class or user-defined function invocation. You return the values\nof these methods and functions within an expression where you reference their\ninvocations, similar to referencing a variable value.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For more information on returning results from remote procedures, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge\nApplication Server: Developing AppServer Applications</cite>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RETURN-VALUE-function__see-also_GC1A1652702792\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d389235e172\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SERVER-statement.html\">CREATE SERVER statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ON-ENDKEY-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ON-ENDKEY-phrase.html\">ON ENDKEY phrase</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ON-ERROR-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ON-ERROR-phrase.html\">ON ERROR phrase</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RETURN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RETURN-statement.html\">RETURN statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"UNDO-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/UNDO-statement.html\">UNDO statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RETURN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RETURN-statement.html\">RETURN statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RGB-VALUE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RGB-VALUE-function.html\">RGB-VALUE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310532","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"RETURN-VALUE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RETURN-VALUE-function.html","type":"Manual"}